# Text files are checked out with LF everywhere. Prettier expects LF, and a
# Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true rewrites the working copy to CRLF,
# which fails `npm run check` there. That includes the Windows release runner,
# so without this the release build stops before it compiles anything.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never text, whatever content sniffing decides.
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.png binary
